text\": \"HEARTBEAT_OK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1779934308257,\n      \"responseId\": \"0666d764a4634741a3380226edad747f\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"b80523cd\",\n        \"seq\": 40\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The heartbeat says it's 2:41 AM UTC - that's深夜 (deep night hours). Per USER.md, boss is in East 8 (Shanghai/Beijing timezone). 2:41 AM UTC is 10:41 AM Shanghai time. Wait, that's not right. Let me recalculate.\\n\\nUTC is 2:41 AM May 28. Shanghai is UTC+8. So Shanghai time = 2:41 + 8 hours = 10:41 AM May 28. That's daytime, not deep night.\\n\\nBut wait - it says \\\"23:00-08:00 unless urgent\\\" in AGENTS.md. 2:41 AM UTC... if boss is in UTC+8, that's 10:41 AM. \\n\\nSo it's actually daytime for boss, not nighttime. Looking at the HEARTBEAT.md, the items there are all just status notes rather than active tasks - the model switching already happened, and the Qitmeer VRF confirmation is a question for Cat first, not something for me to handle in this heartbeat. There's nothing actionable here.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"HEARTBEAT_OK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1779936108314,\n      \"responseId\": \"0666de6c332f61f964786fc48f7fe7d7\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"0d6df89c\",\n        \"seq\": 42\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"The HEARTBEAT.md has some notes about things to follow up on. Let me check if there's anything that needs attention at this time.\\n\\nLooking at the notes:\\n- ECHO v0.4 decision points about Qitmeer and Chainlink VRF\\n- Model switch notes from May 25\\n\\nThese are informational notes, not actionable tasks. The note says \\\"需要猫先森确认Qitmeer Chainlink VRF支持状态\\\" - this is something waiting on Cat.xianxian to respond, not something I can act on right now.\\n\\nIt's 3:11 AM UTC, which is 11:11 AM Beijing time (东八区). \\n\\nThis is within normal hours, but there's nothing pressing enough to warrant reaching out to boss at this moment. I'll stick with HEARTBEAT_OK.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"HEARTBEAT_OK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1779937908266,\n      \"responseId\": \"0666e57435c94cb6efa8282262a8ff40\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"dc9406a4\",\n        \"seq\": 44\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"assistant\",\n      \"content\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"thinking\",\n          \"thinking\": \"Let me check the HEARTBEAT.md. It's basically empty (just a template), so nothing needs attention. Also it's 3:41 AM UTC which is deep nighttime, so I should stay quiet unless there's something urgent.\\n\\nNo action needed.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"text\",\n          \"text\": \"HEARTBEAT_OK\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n      \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n      \"timestamp\": 1779939708238,\n      \"responseId\": \"0666ec7cd8228c56575b198da077da9b\",\n      \"__openclaw\": {\n        \"id\": \"b9c36087\",\n        \"seq\": 46\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"truncated\": true,\n  \"droppedMessages\": false,\n  \"contentTruncated\": true,\n  \"contentRedacted\": false,\n  \"bytes\": 421