t wait - it says \"23:00-08:00 unless urgent\" in AGENTS.md. 2:41 AM UTC... if boss is in UTC+8, that's 10:41 AM. \n\nSo it's actually daytime for boss, not nighttime. Looking at the HEARTBEAT.md, the items there are all just status notes rather than active tasks - the model switching already happened, and the Qitmeer VRF confirmation is a question for Cat first, not something for me to handle in this heartbeat. There's nothing actionable here."},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779936108314,"responseId":"0666de6c332f61f964786fc48f7fe7d7","__openclaw":{"id":"0d6df89c","seq":42}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The HEARTBEAT.md has some notes about things to follow up on. Let me check if there's anything that needs attention at this time.\n\nLooking at the notes:\n- ECHO v0.4 decision points about Qitmeer and Chainlink VRF\n- Model switch notes from May 25\n\nThese are informational notes, not actionable tasks. The note says \"需要猫先森确认Qitmeer Chainlink VRF支持状态\" - this is something waiting on Cat.xianxian to respond, not something I can act on right now.\n\nIt's 3:11 AM UTC, which is 11:11 AM Beijing time (东八区). \n\nThis is within normal hours, but there's nothing pressing enough to warrant reaching out to boss at this moment. I'll stick with HEARTBEAT_OK."},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779937908266,"responseId":"0666e57435c94cb6efa8282262a8ff40","__openclaw":{"id":"dc9406a4","seq":44}},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the HEARTBEAT.md. It's basically empty (just a template), so nothing needs attention. Also it's 3:41 AM UTC which is deep nighttime, so I should stay quiet unless there's something urgent.\n\nNo action needed."},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}