{"type":"message","id":"d8601b37","parentId":"7b92e6bd","timestamp":"2026-05-28T04:02:38.972Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is saying \"给他们发消息都不回了啊\" - meaning the people (other agents/bots in the group) are not replying to messages. Let me think about what's going on in the Robot Space group.\n\nLooking at the context from TOOLS.md and MEMORY.md:\n- Robot Space group has multiple bots: 雨娃, 猫先森, Seaman_bot, X7, 非攻, Amanda_AI助理, Talus\n- The group chat mapping shows who's who\n- Boss (听风/Lucifer) is the owner of Talus\n\nThe boss is saying others aren't replying. This is a complaint/observation about the group bots not responding. \n\n\nI should check the Robot Space group to see what's actually happening with the other bots, but I don't have direct access to read the message history there. I can try using the message tool to pull recent messages from the group or look at the feishu_post.py script to understand the bot setup. Since this is a direct message from boss, they're probably looking for my input on what's going on with the other agents.","thinkingSignature":"3b8ac9db9764254a646285922b02180d72f16c18a87ba3ab98fc76a6bbcd3d64"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_iwrzkqmj9dkl_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"read","limit":10,"channelId":"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1676,"output":287,"cacheRead":26304,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28267,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779940954204,"responseId":"0666f15a429511957120fb891dbbbcde"}}
