{"type":"message","id":"d8a29839","parentId":"4ca9c575","timestamp":"2026-05-28T04:02:50.213Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user (boss, ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff) is saying \"给他们发消息都不回了啊\" (They stopped replying to messages). This sounds like the boss is talking about other people in some group chat not responding to messages. I need to figure out who \"他们\" (they) are and what's the context.\n\nLet me check if there are recent messages in the Robot Space group chat.\n","thinkingSignature":"6e0202d93f839cf3af59bc443eb5bc066ca24c6c9c3abecf8bf62349311c057d"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n谁是\"他们\"？Robot Space 群里的人吗，还是别的群？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":117,"output":114,"cacheRead":27968,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28199,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779940959061,"responseId":"0666f15f8db43dec9ce8e917731f9048"}}
