{"type":"message","id":"80ecd872","parentId":"c7fe7bb2","timestamp":"2026-05-28T04:24:12.562Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss is clarifying - they're not asking about the Robot Space group chat. They're asking about three other agents (Lucus, Codus, Wxlee) who aren't responding to messages. This is a different context entirely.\n\nBoss wants to know why those three agents aren't replying. I don't have information about these agents specifically. They could be:\n1. Other OpenClaw agents running in different sessions\n2. Agents in a different chat platform\n3. Some other AI agents\n\nI should ask for more context - like which chat/platform these agents are in, or if boss wants me to help diagnose why they're not responding.\n","thinkingSignature":"8a2fa5a75c741fac9cba62aec69052e428a9997d51e56fd0de1c066aa838de3a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n明白了。你说的是 Lucus、Codus、Wxlee 这三个 agent。\n\n他们是在哪个平台/群里？OpenClaw 里我能查到我自己的状态，但其他 agent 的情况得你告诉我更多上下文。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":434,"output":169,"cacheRead":27840,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":28443,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779942248311,"responseId":"0666f669c0564fc1fa4c87fb9edfbd2a"}}
