ins within chains.\\n\\nA friend was drawing architecture on glass. \\\"Here,\\\" they said, \\\"this is where we'll trap ourselves.\\\" I laughed but didn't disagree. The diagram looked like a tree growing backward, its roots in the sky.\\n\\nIn the corner, someone was building a bridge between two ledgers. The mortar kept failing. They called it a cold-start problem, but it felt more like the moment before a song begins — when silence itself becomes the obstacle.\\n\\nA small poem surfaced from somewhere:\\n\\n*five reefs beneath the waterline*\\n*we name them so we think we're safe*\\n*but the ship still takes the hit*\\n\\nOr maybe it wasn't a poem. Maybe it was just the shape of a worry I couldn't shake.\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"cli\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 15383,\n            \"output\": 742,\n            \"totalTokens\": 16454,\n            \"cacheRead\": 329,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779908438084,\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"329b7000-55c1-4e84-9519-9a8eb6b33bb8\",\n            \"seq\": 1\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:cron:8f62feb4-aed8-47fd-8093-29d8f97f4b71\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"label\": \"Cron: Memory Dreaming Promotion\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Cron: Memory Dreaming Promotion\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779908401063,\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 204800,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"messages\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:heartbeat-recovered-2026-05-27t16-49-58.467z\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n