{"type":"message","id":"4b4b2113","parentId":"ab93fae7","timestamp":"2026-05-28T04:28:52.320Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the sessions. Let me look at the current status of the three agents mentioned:\n\n1. **Lucus** (`agent:lucus`): Has a session with status \"done\", last updated at 1779916574445 (May 27). Last message was \"嗨，老板 👋\" from Lucus responding to \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\" with a greeting. The session is \"done\".\n\n2. **Codus** (`agent:codus`): Has a session with status \"done\", last updated at 1779940980658 (May 28). The last message was Codus introducing itself to \"听风\". The session is \"done\".\n\n3. **Wxlee** (`agent:wxlee`): Has a session with status \"done\", last updated at 1779916548900 (May 27). The last message was \"在。军师待命，请主公发号施令。\" responding to \"军师\" from \"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50\". The session is \"done\".\n\n\nAll three agents show \"done\" status and the timestamps suggest they haven't been active since May 27-28. The boss is asking why they're not responding to messages, but these sessions only capture direct conversations with this main agent—they might have other active sessions elsewhere that I'm not seeing. These could be separate direct message sessions, not group chats.\n\nLooking at what each agent did: Lucus had a greeting exchange, Codus introduced itself to \"听风\", and Wxlee responded to someone calling it \"军师\". All three sessions ended after a single exchange. The boss says they're not replying, which means either these sessions ended prematurely or they're active in other channels I can't access. I should let the boss know what I'm seeing and ask what platform or group they're using with these agents.","thinkingSignature":"00ec7e1aa0db178897e01811d7d611aa9fbaa161936f71ecfa20bab65dc3fb9b"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看到了。三个 agent 的状态：\n\n- **Lucus**：最后会话 May 27，最后一条是回复\"嗨，老板 👋\"，状态 done\n- **Codus**：最后会话 May 28 02:23，最后一条是自我介绍，状态 done  \n- **Wxlee**：最后会话 May 27，最后一条是回复\"在。军师待命，请主公发号施令。\"，状态 done\n\n都是\"done\"状态——意味着 agent 跑完就停了，不会自动继续。\n\n你说的\"发消息不回\"，是指在哪个平台？Telegram 群？还是别的？如果是 OpenClaw 里的其他 agent，你需要的是——让他们跑起来还是让他们能持续对话？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18489,"output":547,"cacheRead":28576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779942526666,"responseId":"0666f77f29ca0f0e5ca0c133e0e9b799"}}
