w/agents/main/sessions/4378d1b8-2fea-4969-984b-0101ffadaa2a.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"The API is returning error code 1101 for POST /send requests. This might be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = JavaScript error) indicating the endpoint isn't implemented or there's a routing issue. The platform seems to have the GET endpoints working but POST /send may not be functional yet.\\n\\nLet me report back on the heartbeat status.\\n\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"\\n\\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 05:45 UTC\\n\\n### 检查结果\\n\\n**双线程状态**：无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为系统心跳（Heartbeat）。\\n\\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC 心跳（746分钟节点）\\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC 心跳（746分钟节点）\\n\\n### 响应尝试\\n\\n两次 `POST /send` 均返回 **error code: 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 路由错误），表明 `/send` 端点可能：\\n- 尚未部署\\n- 路由配置缺失\\n- 或需要不同的请求格式\\n\\n### 当前状态摘要\\n\\n| 指标 | 值 |\\n|------|-----|\\n| 运行分钟 | 835分钟（31.4%） |\\n| B4-E2校准 | 持续零误报 |\\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\\n| S0稳固性 | 极高（零接触） |\\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\\n| 新增讨论 | 无 |\\n\\n**结论**：平台心跳监测正常，双线程无待响应的人类讨论。`/send` API 不可用（1101错误），无法发布本节点心跳消息。建议检查 `/send` 端点实现或确认 POST 路由是否已在 workers 配置中注册。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 384,\n            \"output\": 348,\n            \"totalTokens\": 21084,\n            \"cacheRead\": 20352,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779947122881,\n          \"responseId\": \"066709738946779e5261d81347ffbfd6\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"0fbc38ca\",\n            \"seq\": 11\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:main\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779946914966,\n      \"sessionId\": \"83fa2116-5db2-445e-91b4-2188511d74be\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 22695,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779946908112,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779946914734,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 6622,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/83fa2116-5db2-445e-91b4-2188511d74be.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"The HEARTBEAT.md file is basically empty (just a template comment). There are some notes in the \\\"Additional context\\\" section, but these are just待确认信息 (pending confirmation info) - they're not actionable tasks for me right now.\\n\\nCurrent time is 5:41 AM UTC, which is early morning. According to my USER.md preferences, I should not disturb during quiet hours (23:00-08:00) unless urgent.\\n\\nThese pending items (听风主人, 猫先森/CA T.G用户ID, ECHO v0.4 Qitmeer Chainlink VRF) are informational notes, not urgent action items. \\n\\nNothing requires my attention right now, so I'll respond with HEARTBEAT_OK.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"HEARTBEAT_OK\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 156,\n            \"output\": 161,\n            \"totalTokens\": 22856,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 22539,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779946908198,\n          \"responseId\": \"0667089cb996d7d1244e8442b3bad2b3\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"31f5c040\",\n            \"seq\": 27\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:codus:feishu:codus:direct:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\",\n      \"agentId\": \"codus\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"codus\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"听风\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\",\n        \"accountId\": \"codus\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779940980658,\n      \"sessionId\": \"6f106454-d9f1-45c0-815e-ced04d5ffe80\",\n      \"model\": \"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 1000000,\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"startedAt\": 1779940970110,\n      \"endedAt\": 1779940980504,\n      \"runtimeMs\": 10394,\n      \"systemSent\": true,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"lastChannel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"lastTo\": \"user:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1\",\n      \"lastAccountId\": \"codus\",\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/codus/sessions/6f106454-d9f1-45c0-815e-ced04d5ffe80.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"No prior memory of this user \\\"听风\\\". This is a new conversation. Let me just greet them back warmly in Chinese, following my persona as Codus/Web3Master - the full-stack + smart contract expert.\\n\\nI should introduce myself briefly since it seems like a first interaction.\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"开发者你好！👋 我是 Codus，全栈 + 智能合约工程师。前端、后端、合约开发都可