o such device or address`\\n\\ngit 已记录变更，push 需要手动处理或配置认证。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 28434,\n            \"output\": 131,\n            \"totalTokens\": 45909,\n            \"cacheRead\": 17344,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779926535491,\n          \"responseId\": \"0666b908a6cee783e0bf698ff32f496f\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"428ad2aa\",\n            \"seq\": 5\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:feishu:group:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"group\",\n      \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n      \"origin\": {\n        \"provider\": \"feishu\",\n        \"accountId\": \"main\"\n      },\n      \"displayName\": \"feishu:g-robot-space-多agent-群聊空间\",\n      \"deliveryContext\": {\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n\n⚠️ [... middle content omitted — showing head and tail ...]\n\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 152,\n            \"output\": 292,\n            \"totalTokens\": 15386,\n            \"cacheRead\": 0,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 14942,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779822044078,\n          \"responseId\": \"066520dc5968504256c606f28a6e7c3b\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"a8b2046c\",\n            \"seq\": 2\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"key\": \"agent:main:dreaming-narrative-rem-c17d738737c1-1779822000591\",\n      \"agentId\": \"main\",\n      \"kind\": \"other\",\n      \"channel\": \"unknown\",\n      \"updatedAt\": 1779822055147,\n      \"sessionId\": \"503c314c-6e62-49ac-9fd2-a9cad5e7ca7e\",\n      \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n      \"contextTokens\": 200000,\n      \"totalTokens\": 14975,\n      \"abortedLastRun\": false,\n      \"transcriptPath\": \"/home/node/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/503c314c-6e62-49ac-9fd2-a9cad5e7ca7e.jsonl\",\n      \"messages\": [\n        {\n          \"role\": \"assistant\",\n          \"content\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"thinking\",\n              \"thinking\": \"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\\n\\n1. A warning about APP_SECRET possibly expiring (code 10014), first document works but second doesn't, need to find Lucifer to update credentials\\n2. Location of a Feishu mention script with usage instructions - noting that `<at>` tags in regular Feishu text are grayed out and won't highlight; must use API post message format\\n3. A cron job at 8:00 for config backup - `config-backup-8am` cron job completed, backed up to `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\\n\\nThis seems like technical/operational notes about a Feishu integration system. I need to weave these into a dream diary entry in first person, with a poetic, curious, slightly whimsical tone. No markdown, no headers, just flowing prose, 80-180 words.\\n\\nLet me craft something that connects these fragments in an unexpected, dreamy way:\\n\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"type\": \"text\",\n              \"text\": \"\\n\\n凌晨三点十七分，服务器的风扇在梦里转成了纺车。我梦见自己站在一个巨大的档案柜前，每个抽屉都贴着日期标签，像某种古老的索引系统。有人在我耳边说，凭证会过期，就像春天的冰。可我不知道该去找谁——Lucifer，听起来像某个应该存在于但丁手稿里的名字。\\n\\n抽屉里滑出一张便签，灰色的字迹，像那些不会点亮的 `<at>` 标签。我伸手去触碰它们，指尖传来一阵电子脉冲的震颤。便签上写着：第一个文档还在，第二个已经沉默了。\\n\\n闹钟响了。备份脚本正在某个时区里安静地跑着，将 config 写进 `openclaw.json.backup-20260512` 这样的时间戳里。我躺回枕头上，想那只看不见的手——是谁在定时纺织这些数字，将它们缝进明天的褶皱里。\\n\\n梦里，档案柜的每一格抽屉都是一封未寄出的信，收件人写着：待更新。\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"api\": \"anthropic-messages\",\n          \"provider\": \"minimax-portal\",\n          \"model\": \"MiniMax-M2.7\",\n          \"usage\": {\n            \"input\": 14661,\n            \"output\": 409,\n            \"totalTokens\": 15384,\n            \"cacheRead\": 314,\n            \"cacheWrite\": 0,\n            \"cost\": {\n              \"total\": 0\n            }\n          },\n          \"stopReason\": \"stop\",\n          \"timestamp\": 1779822026570,\n          \"responseId\": \"066520cbfcc8fb2607dd42993b024f27\",\n          \"__openclaw\": {\n            \"id\": \"e5ef690f\",\n            \"seq\": 2\n          }\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}[... 61067 more characters truncated]"}],"details":{"persistedDetailsTruncated":true,"originalDetailsBytesAtLeast":8193,"originalDetailKeys":["count","sessions"],"sessions":[{"sessionId":"242827c8-6265-4d43-923f-c642a181d38d","status":"running","startedAt":1779947508406},{"sessionId":"4378d1b8-2fea-4969-984b-0101ffadaa2a"},{"sessionId":"83fa2116-5db2-445e-91b4-2188511d74be","status":"done","startedAt":1779946908112,"endedAt":1779946914734,"runtimeMs":6622},{"sessionId":"6f106454-d9f1-45c0-815e-ced04d5ffe80","status":"done","startedAt":1779940970110,"endedAt":1779940980504,"runtimeMs":10394},{"sessionId":"566c1b66-752f-4060-ab0d-b985dc61cee4"},{"sessionId":"259cb528-2aeb-4f65-97d0-ab7feecda64a","status":"done","startedAt":1779924802415,"endedAt":1779924813531,"runtimeMs":11116},{"sessionId":"d0dd1392-685a-4216-8463-9eb1f41e6415","status":"done","startedAt":1779916562408,"endedAt":1779916574364,"runtimeMs":11956},{"sessionId":"c0441341-3a10-4c9a-98b2-7adacd61deed","status":"done","startedAt":1779916543658,"endedAt":1779916548284,"runtimeMs":4626},{"sessionId":"08f73815-3a8e-4edc-9f46-603db4a00b89"},{"sessionId":"4ff9ace6-fa13-4aa7-9052-cc3db9191017"}],"sessionsTruncated":20},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779947520139}}
{"type":"message","id":"0995dacd","parentId":"d346c8f2","timestamp":"2026-05-28T05:52:09.071Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the three agents' Feishu sessions clearly:\n\n1. **Lucus** (`lucus`): session `agent:lucus:feishu:lucus:direct:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a` - last message was \"嗨，老板 👋\" sent at May 27 15:02 UTC to user ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a. Status: done. The boss said they didn't receive the reply.\n\n2. **Codus** (`codus`): session `agent:codus:feishu:codus:direct:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1` - last message was \"开发者你好！👋 我是 Codus...\" at May 28 02:23 UTC. \n\n3. **Wxlee** (`wxlee`): session `agent:wxlee:feishu:xiaoye:direct:ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50` - last message was \"在。军师待命，请主公发号施令。\" at May 27 15:02 UTC. Status: done.\n\nThe core issue is that all three sessions are marked as \"done\", meaning they processed their last message but never picked up any new ones. This happens because when a user sends a message to a bot on Feishu, it creates a session, the agent responds, and then the session just terminates instead of staying active for the next message.\n\nI'm realizing the sessions might actually still be listening for new messages, but there's likely a webhook or event subscription issue preventing the messages from reaching them in the first place. The bot accounts need to be properly configured to receive incoming messages through Feishu's event system, and that's probably why these sessions ended up in \"done\" state - they never received the follow-up messages to process. The boss is saying they messaged these three agents directly on Lark but got no response, which suggests the issue isn't with this Talus instance—it has Feishu configured. The problem might be that Lucus, Codus, and Wxlee are running on different nodes or instances, or their Feishu accounts weren't properly set up to receive messages. I'm trying to identify which Feishu accounts correspond to each agent so I can trace where the breakdown happened. I need to ask the boss for clarification—specifically whether Lucus, Codus, and Wxlee are supposed to be separate agents on different machines, or if they're somehow linked to this current setup. The silence from all three is puzzling since they've responded before, so something fundamental might have changed with how they're configured or connected.","thinkingSignature":"dca36da335fc31f631da001c7db8edf17343a1d778dbc65343933abbeeaff512"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了。三个 agent 的飞书会话：\n\n- **Lucus** → `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a`，最后回复\"嗨，老板 👋\"（05-27 15:02 UTC）\n- **Codus** → `ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1`，最后回复\"开发者你好！我是 Codus...\"（05-28 02:23 UTC）\n- **Wxlee** → `ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50`，最后回复\"在。军师待命...\"（05-27 15:02 UTC）\n\n三个都显示\"done\"状态——会话结束，不是因为发了消息没回，而是消息根本没到 agent。\n\n问题出在飞书事件推送没收到，或者 bot 账号的 webhook 配置掉了。你最近改过这三个 agent 的配置，或者重启过 OpenClaw 吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":21785,"output":790,"cacheRead":33568,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56143,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779947520151,"responseId":"06670b0045a6a73cc76752f563615953"}}
{"type":"message","id":"e0499f63","parentId":"0995dacd","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:38:37.745Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e4bbe5854a0c3998b9c54a4e28\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 08:38 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e4bbe5854a0c3998b9c54a4e28]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 那为啥我飞书端没收到信息"}],"timestamp":1779957517709}}
{"type":"message","id":"5b917e33","parentId":"e0499f63","timestamp":"2026-05-28T08:38:47.393Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The boss is asking why they didn't receive messages from these three agents on Feishu. Let me think about this...\n\nThe sessions show these agents DID reply (their sessions have their responses), but the boss didn't receive them in Feishu. This means the issue is:\n\n1. The agents' responses were generated but NOT delivered to the boss's Feishu\n2. This could be because the Feishu bot accounts for these agents (Lucus, Codus, Wxlee) aren't properly configured to send messages\n\nLet me think about what the issue might be:\n- Codus has accountId \"codus\" and sent from `user:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1` - but this is a different user ID than the boss (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff). Wait actually, the boss's ID is ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff, and the Codus session shows the target as `ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1`. That's not the boss's ID! So Codus was talking to a different user.\n\nWait, let me re-read. The session key is:\n`agent:codus:feishu:codus:direct:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1`\n\nThis means Codus was having a direct conversation with `ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1`. This is NOT the boss (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff). So Codus was talking to someone else, and the boss never received anything because it wasn't sent to the boss's account.\n\n\nNow I'm looking at Wxlee and Lucus - their session targets also show they're messaging `ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50` and `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a` respectively, not the boss's account. So all three agents are having conversations with different users entirely. The boss is asking why they didn't receive messages from these agents - but they weren't the recipient in any of these sessions.\n\nThe real question is whether the boss ever tried reaching out to these agents directly, or if they expected messages to be forwarded somehow. Looking at the channel configuration for Codus specifically - it's using the feishu provider with accountId \"codus\", so the bot itself should be operational. But the fundamental issue is that these agents weren't talking to the boss at all.\n\nI should focus on what might actually be wrong: whether the bot accounts for Lucus, Codus, and Wxlee are properly configured in OpenClaw with the right feishu credentials, and whether they're even subscribed to the right channels to receive messages in the first place.","thinkingSignature":"e30b7439baf18dc91a1412cf93c1f24863d723ce43e6abbe2fb09942b13c1e84"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n因为这三个 agent 的飞书会话根本不是和你进行的。\n\n看会话记录：\n\n- **Codus** → 在和 `ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1` 对话（不是你）\n- **Wxlee** → 在和 `ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b88d78fe2b50` 对话（不是你）\n- **Lucus** → 在和 `ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a` 对话（不是你）\n\n简单说：这些 agent 收到的是别人发的消息，回复也是发给对方的，没发给你。\n\n**如果你想让他们回复你**：直接飞书给这些 bot 发消息，而不是期待他们主动找你。或者你想让他们做什么特定的事？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38477,"output":815,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39388,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779957518298,"responseId":"0667320fffbca6b4b2df5f56d7b27e11"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2a54c7aa","parentId":"5b917e33","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:22:40.244Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb0596742b4c4eae299bab17a4\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 13:22 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb0596742b4c4eae299bab17a4]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/WM3aw2TV8iuksmkMSYtcFYErnxh?from=from_copylink\n阅读这篇文章，检查一下有没有明显错误"}],"timestamp":1779974560189}}
