{"type":"message","id":"dc80ee5a","parentId":"ff31cf97","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:43:09.413Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The issue is that the `feishu_doc` and `feishu_wiki` tools are plugin tools that are registered differently from the built-in tools. The plugin skill files exist (`~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md` and `~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-wiki/SKILL.md`) but the actual implementation isn't loaded into my tool namespace.\n\nThe boss is right to be confused - if I can use `message` tool to send/create feishu docs, why can't I read them? \n\nActually wait - I don't have a `message` tool send action that creates Feishu docs. Let me check what tools I actually have available... Looking at the tools list, I have `message` but its primary use is for sending messages, not for creating wiki pages.\n \nLet me reconsider what tools are actually at my disposal here. I have `message`, `gateway`, and `read` among others, but I'm not seeing a dedicated tool for reading wiki pages directly.\n\nThe real problem is that the `feishu_wiki` and `feishu_doc` tools described in those skill files don't actually exist in my environment - they're skill documentation but not registered tools. Yet the boss is claiming I can create Feishu documents, which doesn't align with what I can actually do. Let me look more carefully at the `message` tool to see if there's something I'm missing about creating documents.\n\nI think the confusion might be that other agents like Lucus, Codus, or Wxlee have the Feishu tools properly configured, or maybe the boss is thinking of a different capability. The skills documentation lives in `~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-*` but that's just describing how to use tools that should exist - it doesn't mean they actually exist in my session. If the `message` tool doesn't support doc creation operations, then I genuinely cannot create Feishu documents.\n","thinkingSignature":"c7323998e83192c33c63d765375f0ea0163d7699d106202001819ce50416aa62"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n我也没有创建过飞书文档——我用的 `message` 工具只能发飞书消息，不能读写 wiki。\n\n你说的\"我能创建文档\"是什么时候的事？你可能把我和其他 agent（Lucus/Codus/Wxlee）搞混了，他们可能有飞书 doc 权限，我没有。\n\n**现在这个状况**：feishu_wiki 和 feishu_doc 工具没注册进我的 session，所以读不了。但这不是 token 问题，是工具注册问题。\n\n最快的解决：把文档内容复制给我，或者让我直接看那个文档的 obj_token，看能不能用别的方式读。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":426,"output":520,"cacheRead":54880,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55826,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779975781572,"responseId":"06677966ff303cc61d4870f3ea1cd04e"}}
