{"type":"message","id":"7cac869e","parentId":"70ed36b5","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:46:58.583Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The boss says I created a Feishu doc before and is telling me to test again. Let me try the message tool with action=send to see if there's a document creation capability, or check if there's a different way to create documents.\n\nActually, looking at the message tool, it has actions like send, read, edit, thread-reply, pin, list-pins, unpin, member-info, channel-info, channel-list, react, reactions, read - no document creation.\n\nWait, but the boss is insisting I created a Feishu doc before. Maybe it was Lucus/Codus/Wxlee who did it, not me (Talus/main). Or maybe the boss is confusing sessions.\n \nThe boss is getting frustrated, so I should just try calling the message tool with action=send to see what happens - if it fails, that confirms I don't have doc creation权限, and I'll need to explain that to them.","thinkingSignature":"94fc0633b2a69f7b113225d9421b88b0f977524ff0c3242d7b8942f0d665be52"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7d9ckv0cht6d_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","target":"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff","message":"test"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":902,"output":258,"cacheRead":54592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55752,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976012634,"responseId":"06677a4d99cb25e60b0e81e1c381a0a2"}}
