{"type":"message","id":"b1693ba6","parentId":"3953acf4","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:53:30.398Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_urzz6mkzsms9_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"SKILL.md\n---\nname: feishu-wiki\ndescription: |\n  Feishu knowledge base navigation. Activate when user mentions knowledge base, wiki, or wiki links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Wiki Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_wiki` for knowledge base operations.\n\nWiki `space_id` values are opaque strings. Always keep them quoted in tool calls, even when they contain only digits; passing a long numeric-looking ID as a number can corrupt the suffix due to JavaScript number precision limits.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/wiki/ABC123def` → `token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### List Knowledge Spaces\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"spaces\" }\n```\n\nReturns all accessible wiki spaces.\n\n### List Nodes\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"nodes\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\" }"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":108,"aggregated":"SKILL.md\n---\nname: feishu-wiki\ndescription: |\n  Feishu knowledge base navigation. Activate when user mentions knowledge base, wiki, or wiki links.\n---\n\n# Feishu Wiki Tool\n\nSingle tool `feishu_wiki` for knowledge base operations.\n\nWiki `space_id` values are opaque strings. Always keep them quoted in tool calls, even when they contain only digits; passing a long numeric-looking ID as a number can corrupt the suffix due to JavaScript number precision limits.\n\n## Token Extraction\n\nFrom URL `https://xxx.feishu.cn/wiki/ABC123def` → `token` = `ABC123def`\n\n## Actions\n\n### List Knowledge Spaces\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"spaces\" }\n```\n\nReturns all accessible wiki spaces.\n\n### List Nodes\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"nodes\", \"space_id\": \"7xxx\" }","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779976410385}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6c7409e","parentId":"b1693ba6","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:53:35.488Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The feishu-wiki skill file exists, but it's just a markdown SKILL.md - not the actual JavaScript implementation. The actual tool implementation must be somewhere else. Let me check how OpenClaw resolves tools. The skills directory has SKILL.md files but the actual tool execution might be in the dist/index.js or somewhere in the feishu npm package.\n\nLet me look at the dist/index.js to understand how the feishu plugin is structured.","thinkingSignature":"1f11da99a9d3201de2dc9fe4a830b257111a8bd3f7a50d003a33a0cd4969c857"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h34edsy4bk61_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"head -100 ~/.openclaw/npm/node_modules/@openclaw/feishu/dist/index.js 2>/dev/null | grep -i 'wiki\\|doc\\|tool'","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":316,"output":162,"cacheRead":65344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65822,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976410423,"responseId":"06677bdb8348b56e8b5ce2c09b259f1f"}}
