{"type":"message","id":"82389a34","parentId":"b4598b5a","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:53:56.481Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The wiki token in the URL is actually the `node_token`, not a `space_id`. I need to use the wiki API properly. Let me try the correct API endpoint.\n\nFor the wiki v2 API:\n- `GET /open-apis/wiki/v2/spaces/get?token=*** - this gets the space info from a node token\n\nActually, the error says `space_id is not int`, which means the API is treating the token as a space_id integer. But the wiki URL token format `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` is a node token (like `wikcnXXX` format), not a space ID (which is numeric).\n\n\nI need to get the obj_token from the wiki node first, then use that to fetch the actual document content. Let me call the wiki node API to extract the document token from the URL token.","thinkingSignature":"33a40b5dd2feb6d18a92b0a7985d2f2b5e8aca0055ac05f461dccbda6a073c4e"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n0by5c5jo4ne_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\n\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: 'k0S58I…PNOT' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    // Get wiki node info - token from URL is node_token\n    const wikiOpts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/wiki/v2/nodes/get?token=MKJtwW…bnoc', method: 'GET', headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token } };\n    const wr = https.request(wikiOpts, wr => {\n      let wd = '';\n      wr.on('data', c => wd += c);\n      wr.on('end', () => {\n        console.log(wd.slice(0, 1000));\n      });\n    });\n    wr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":542,"output":540,"cacheRead":66240,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67322,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976429325,"responseId":"06677bee8550b395c84b09ee5f1f3c24"}}
