{"type":"message","id":"eaa9b9e4","parentId":"fc0a3a3c","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:54:18.827Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The token works, but the wiki spaces list is empty. This might mean the bot doesn't have access to the wiki space that contains that document. Or the document is in a personal space rather than a wiki space.\n\nLet me try to get the document directly via the docx API. The URL structure `wiki/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` - let me check if this is a wiki node token or a doc token.\n\nActually, wait - the space list returns empty. That could mean the bot account (main/Talus) doesn't have access to any wiki spaces. Let me try the docx API directly with the token.\n\n\nI'll attempt to fetch the document metadata using the docx endpoint with the access token.","thinkingSignature":"22309fcf3f71090a1ab1c85f324a036e12fe320ec8a88e6fab18222fb0f50c40"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\ntoken 能正常获取，但 wiki spaces 返回空——可能这个文档所在的 space Talus 没有权限访问。\n\n直接试试 docx API：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_itjoev557doy_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: 'k0S58I…PNOT' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    // Try docx directly - maybe the URL token is actually a doc token  \n    const docOpts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/raw', method: 'GET', headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token } };\n    const dr = https.request(docOpts, dres => {\n      let dd = '';\n      dres.on('data', c => dd += c);\n      dres.on('end', () => console.log(dd.slice(0, 500)));\n    });\n    dr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":425,"output":535,"cacheRead":67520,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68480,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976453111,"responseId":"06677c059614c2095dda52d014772632"}}
