{"type":"message","id":"994925b4","parentId":"c84a33a4","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:54:26.247Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The wiki node token `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` doesn't work with the wiki API (spaces are empty), and doesn't work with docx API (404). This suggests the token format might not be what I think it is, OR the app doesn't have access to this wiki node.\n\nSince the app has `wiki:wiki` permission scope (boss said they gave full permissions), but the spaces list returns empty - this could mean the wiki is owned by a different organization or the bot isn't a member of that wiki space.\n\nActually, wait - let me reconsider. The URL `https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` - the path component after `/wiki/` is `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc`. \n\nIn Feishu wiki, both spaces and individual nodes have tokens, and I can't tell which one this is from the format alone. The real issue might be that the wiki is in an organic Feishu environment while the bot is configured for Feishu SSO, so there's likely an org mismatch preventing access. Given how much time I've already spent on this, I should just ask the boss to paste the document content directly.","thinkingSignature":"ee61f0a37befcb14d9566044942a14a4c3e89fe68e7038f7c7652a2872a5e7bb"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好，我拿到 token 了，但这个 wiki 文档的 token 调 API 返回空（spaces 是空的），说明要么是这个 token 指向的 wiki 空间不在这个 app 的权限范围内，要么是 token 类型不匹配。\n\n你之前说\"这是我之前测试的\"——那你能把那篇文档的内容直接贴过来吗？我真的找不到这个工具的注册入口，继续排查是死胡同。\n\n你粘贴过来，我看一眼告诉你有没有明显错误，五分钟搞定。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":378,"output":376,"cacheRead":67936,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68690,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779976459545,"responseId":"06677c0c03b0ea685ed38302cbaf77f2"}}
{"type":"message","id":"55208cd7","parentId":"994925b4","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:55:14.412Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb0dd37acacc250412ee3fa8ef\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 13:55 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb0dd37acacc250412ee3fa8ef]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: Talus 测试报告\n这是在 Feishu Wiki 文档中由 Talus 写入的测试内容。\n通过 OpenClaw Feishu 工具写入 \\- 2026\\-05\\-19\n1. Wiki 节点访问 \\- ✅\n2. 文档读取 \\- ✅\n3. 文档写入 \\- ✅\n4. Markdown 内容渲染 \\- ✅\nTalus测试写入\n请继续输入："}],"timestamp":1779976514384}}
{"type":"message","id":"03dae2f2","parentId":"55208cd7","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:55:20.549Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is showing me the content of the document that Talus wrote. So the feishu wiki tool DID work at some point - Talus wrote this document on 2026-05-19. The document content is visible in the message. Now I can check it for obvious errors.\n\nLet me analyze the content:\n\n```\nTalus 测试报告\n这是在 Feishu Wiki 文档中由 Talus 写入的测试内容。\n通过 OpenClaw Feishu 工具写入 - 2026-05-19\n1. Wiki 节点访问 - ✅\n2. 文档读取 - ✅\n3. 文档写入 - ✅\n4. Markdown 内容渲染 - ✅\nTalus测试写入\n请继续输入：\n\n\n```\n\nLooking at this test report, everything checks out - the timestamp formatting is correct with the year-month-day pattern, and the OpenClaw tool integration with Feishu Wiki appears to be functioning properly.\n\n```\n","thinkingSignature":"8fd594a46c3a9f722b1f66fe83e6aa41f5367eb4cbe0a89c2765efbe350664a8"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n看到了。这是之前 Talus（就是我）写的测试报告。\n\n**检查结果：无明显错误。**\n\n内容本身没问题，是一份正常的测试记录。格式清晰，时间戳正确。\n\n你说\"检查有没有明显错误\"——你是想检查这个文档本身的格式/内容问题，还是想让我帮你检查别的文档？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":5255,"output":257,"cacheRead":63136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779976514462,"responseId":"06677c43606ea7f62b61cad48ba1240f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5ad91f36","parentId":"03dae2f2","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:56:27.923Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb0d6bd5cacc3f33b2a0be7da0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 13:56 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb0d6bd5cacc3f33b2a0be7da0]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 我是想让你搞清楚正确的飞书文档读写能力，然后继续在这个测试文档里测试"}],"timestamp":1779976587885}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff42eecd","parentId":"5ad91f36","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:56:34.174Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The boss wants me to figure out the correct way to read/write Feishu wiki docs, and then test in that test document. Let me investigate how Talus was able to write to the wiki before.\n\nThe fact that Talus previously wrote to this wiki doc means the tools ARE available somehow. Let me check the current config more carefully to see if there's a wiki-specific config I'm missing.\n\nLet me look at the feishu plugin config in detail.\n","thinkingSignature":"9f71cf77aae17c755b0154f5e03934dd4a32c909a289ddcd1e01c7f756aa4505"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bnmyo5z0fnpa_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && cat openclaw.json | python3 -c \"\nimport sys, json\nd = json.load(sys.stdin)\nfeishu = d.get('channels', {}).get('feishu', {})\n# Print full feishu config except secrets\nfor k, v in feishu.items():\n    if k == 'appSecret': continue\n    if k == 'accounts':\n        for acc, vals in v.items():\n            print(f'  accounts.{acc}:')\n            for ak, av in vals.items():\n                if ak == 'appSecret': continue\n                print(f'    {ak}: {av}')\n    else:\n        print(f'{k}: {v}')\n\"","timeout":5}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":536,"output":270,"cacheRead":68000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68806,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976587976,"responseId":"06677c8cc4639c9660216a40161f1e89"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1f0435af","parentId":"ff42eecd","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:56:34.493Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_bnmyo5z0fnpa_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled: True\nrequireMention: True\ndefaultAccount: main\ntypingIndicator: True\nresolveSenderNames: True\n  accounts.main:\n    appId: cli_aa8198b425389cef\n    name: Talus\n    domain: feishu\n  accounts.lucus:\n    appId: cli_a93108fad2b81e15\n    name: Lucus\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.codus:\n    appId: cli_a9417983f678de17\n    name: Codus\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.xiaoye:\n    appId: cli_a965de5a7b78de17\n    name: xiaoye\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.custor:\n    appId: cli_aa985d88e5f85cc5\n    name: Custor\n    domain: feishu\n  accounts.default:\n    dmPolicy: pairing\n    groupPolicy: open\nconnectionMode: websocket\nreactionNotifications: own\ngroupAllowFrom: ['oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2']\ntools: {'doc': True}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":103,"aggregated":"enabled: True\nrequireMention: True\ndefaultAccount: main\ntypingIndicator: True\nresolveSenderNames: True\n  accounts.main:\n    appId: cli_aa8198b425389cef\n    name: Talus\n    domain: feishu\n  accounts.lucus:\n    appId: cli_a93108fad2b81e15\n    name: Lucus\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.codus:\n    appId: cli_a9417983f678de17\n    name: Codus\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.xiaoye:\n    appId: cli_a965de5a7b78de17\n    name: xiaoye\n    domain: lark\n  accounts.custor:\n    appId: cli_aa985d88e5f85cc5\n    name: Custor\n    domain: feishu\n  accounts.default:\n    dmPolicy: pairing\n    groupPolicy: open\nconnectionMode: websocket\nreactionNotifications: own\ngroupAllowFrom: ['oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2']\ntools: {'doc': True}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779976594460}}
{"type":"message","id":"b9fb46fb","parentId":"1f0435af","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:56:40.964Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The config shows `tools: {'doc': True}` - so the doc tool is enabled! But the feishu_wiki tool isn't enabled. Let me check if there's a wiki tool config too.\n\nBut the issue is - the tools are enabled in config, but that doesn't mean they got registered. Let me check if the feishu doc tool is available to me.\n\nActually, looking at the SKILL.md for feishu-wiki and feishu-doc, they say to use `feishu_wiki` and `feishu_doc` tools. But these tools aren't in my available tools list. \n\nThe issue might be that these tools are registered per-agent, and I need to check how the tool registration works. Let me look at what tools I actually have available.\n\nActually wait - maybe the tool registration happens at runtime. The plugins installfeishu has `registerFeishuDocTools` etc. But these need to be explicitly registered with the agent. \n\nSince config shows `tools: {doc: True}`, the question is why isn't `feishu_doc` showing up in my available tools? Let me try calling it directly to see if it works.\n\nThe SKILL.md says the tool is `feishu_doc`, so let me try invoking it to test.\n","thinkingSignature":"68426bfc97d3148465549c8bb15551436ef586675ddc0d41abd69d60bdf70837"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n配置里 `tools: {doc: True}` 已开启，但工具没进来。让我直接测一下 `feishu_doc` 工具能不能用。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gsfi0fe4oq6v_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\n// Try to call feishu_doc tool directly via API\nconst https = require('https');\n\n// Get token\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: '***' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    // Read doc content via raw endpoint\n    const docOpts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc', method: 'GET', headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token } };\n    const dr = https.request(docOpts, dres => {\n      let dd = '';\n      dres.on('data', c => dd += c);\n      dres.on('end', () => {\n        console.log('doc result:', dd.slice(0, 500));\n      });\n    });\n    dr.on('error', e => console.log('err:', e.message));\n    dr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.on('error', e => console.log('err:', e.message));\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":463,"output":682,"cacheRead":68512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69657,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976594499,"responseId":"06677c930911c87adf8a54581212dc2d"}}
