{"type":"message","id":"48f6f574","parentId":"5b7dd7b3","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:56:47.450Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API returns 99991668 \"Invalid access token\". But I just got the token in the previous call. Let me check if the token format is correct. The token format for tenant_access_token should be used as \"Bearer {token}\". Let me check if the feishu API needs user_access_token instead of tenant_access_token for doc reading.\n\nActually, looking at the error code 99991668, it says \"Invalid access token\". This could mean:\n1. The token is expired\n2. The token doesn't have the right permissions\n3. I'm using tenant_access_token but the API needs user_access_token\n\nFor wiki/doc reading, it might need user_access_token. \n\nSince the user mentioned they wrote to this doc before, maybe they're using a different token type or the permissions are set up differently than I'm assuming.\n","thinkingSignature":"88db0d8394bc505dbc97be6376da5bb01455b764f883b99eae47a8f1202e7b1d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wunbcvfdyz3g_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: '***' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const r = JSON.parse(d);\n    const token = r.tenant_access_token;\n    console.log('code:', r.code, 'token:', token);\n    \n    // Try wiki node with obj_type\n    const wikiOpts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/wiki/v2/nodes/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc?obj_type=docx', method: 'GET', headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token } };\n    const wr = https.request(wikiOpts, wres => {\n      let wd = '';\n      wres.on('data', c => wd += c);\n      wres.on('end', () => console.log('wiki node:', wd.slice(0, 500)));\n    });\n    wr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":524,"output":528,"cacheRead":68960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":70012,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779976601661,"responseId":"06677c9a8e0594c70c6c866a7743ddd3"}}
