{"type":"message","id":"1f33eab0","parentId":"b9184ea2","timestamp":"2026-05-28T13:57:41.620Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_5o2c5zviu8p8_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"later summaries.\",\"filePath\":\"/app/skills/taskflow-inbox-triage/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"/app/skills/taskflow-inbox-triage\",\"source\":\"openclaw-bundled\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"/app/skills/taskflow-inbox-triage\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"/app/skills/taskflow-inbox-triage/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-bundled\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true},{\"id\":\"tavily\",\"name\":\"tavily\",\"description\":\"Tavily web search, content extraction, and research tools.\",\"filePath\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/plugin-skills/tavily/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/plugin-skills/tavily\",\"source\":\"openclaw-extra\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/plugin-skills/tavily\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/plugin-skills/tavily/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-extra\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true},{\"id\":\"ui-ux-pro-max\",\"name\":\"ui-ux-pro-max\",\"description\":\"UI/UX design intelligence and implementation guidance for building polished interfaces. Use when the user asks for UI design, UX flows, information architecture, visual style direction, design systems/tokens, component specs, copy/microcopy, accessibility, or to generate/critique/refine frontend UI (HTML/CSS/JS, React, Next.js, Vue, Svelte, Tailwind). Includes workflows for (1) generating new UI layouts and styling, (2) improving existing UI/UX, (3) producing design-system tokens and component guidelines, and (4) turning UX recommendations into concrete code changes.\",\"filePath\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/ui-ux-pro-max\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/ui-ux-pro-max\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true},{\"id\":\"vitest-testing\",\"name\":\"vitest-testing\",\"description\":\"Vitest testing framework patterns and best practices. Use when writing unit tests, integration tests, configuring vitest.config, mocking with vi.mock/vi.fn, using snapshots, or setting up test coverage. Triggers on describe, it, expect, vi.mock, vi.fn, beforeEach, afterEach, vitest.\",\"filePath\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/vitest-testing/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/vitest-testing\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/vitest-testing\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/vitest-testing/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true},{\"id\":\"weather\",\"name\":\"weather\",\"description\":\"Current weather and forecasts with wttr.in via curl for locations, rain, temperature, travel planning.\",\"filePath\":\"/app/skills/weather/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"/app/skills/weather\",\"source\":\"openclaw-bundled\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"/app/skills/weather\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"/app/skills/weather/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-bundled\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true},{\"id\":\"web3-docs\",\"name\":\"web3-docs\",\"description\":\"Up-to-date documentation and code patterns for Solidity, Foundry, Hardhat, Viem, Wagmi, ethers.js, and OpenZeppelin. Use when writing smart contracts, debugging Solidity errors, setting up a Foundry project, writing Viem/Wagmi frontend code, or asking about ERC standards, gas optimization, upgradeable contracts, or any EVM development task. Triggers on: Solidity, Foundry, Hardhat, Viem, Wagmi, ethers.js, OpenZeppelin, ERC-20, ERC-721, ERC-4626, UUPS, proxy patterns, ABI, calldata, smart contract, deploy, cast, forge, anvil, or any EVM/blockchain development question.\",\"filePath\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/web3-docs/SKILL.md\",\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/web3-docs\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\",\"sourceInfo\":{\"baseDir\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/web3-docs\",\"origin\":\"top-level\",\"path\":\"$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/workspace/skills/web3-docs/SKILL.md\",\"scope\":\"project\",\"source\":\"openclaw-workspace\"},\"disableModelInvocation\":false,\"available\":true}]},\"prompting\":{\"skillsPrompt\":\"\\n\\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\\nWhen a skill file references a relative path, resolve it against the skill directory (parent of SKILL.md / dirname of the path) and use that absolute path in tool commands.\\n\\n<available_skills>\\n  <skill>\\n    <name>Agent Browser</name>\\n    <description>A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.</description>\\n    <location>~/.openclaw/skills/agent-browser/SKILL.md</location>\\n  </skill>\\n  <skill>\\n    <name>automation-workflows</name>\\n    <description>Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on &quot;automate&quot;, &quot;automation&quot;, &quot;workflow automation&quot;, &quot;save time&quot;, 