{"type":"message","id":"ce26f129","parentId":"26915050","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:18.160Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I keep getting 404 on the write endpoint. But the read for blocks works. The issue is likely the URL path for blocks children. Let me check the exact Feishu API path.\n\nFor the Feishu docx API, to add block children, the endpoint should be:\n`POST /open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{document_id}/blocks/{block_id}/children`\n\nWait - that's it! To add children to a block, you need to target the specific parent block, not the document root. But I was trying to use the document ID. Let me try with the root block ID.\n\nActually, looking at the API docs more carefully - to append blocks to the document root, you need to use:\n\n\n`POST /open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{document_id}/blocks/{block_id}/children`\n\nBut maybe I should try just targeting the document-level endpoint instead - I believe there's also a way to add children at the root level without needing a specific block ID.\n\nLet me test the actual API endpoint I'm hitting. I'm getting 404s, which suggests the issue might be with the URL path itself. Looking at the Feishu API docs, for wiki documents the token might not be a valid document ID, so maybe this document isn't actually a docx but something else. Let me try appending blocks to a known block ID using the correct format: `POST /open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{document_id}/blocks/{block_id}/children`. I'll grab the root block ID from my earlier query and attempt to add content there.","thinkingSignature":"d02773c56a643ee236d732f99638158ad298ae84b523d44d88be63c9ee966abe"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n找到了——能读但写失败。问题是写 blocks 需要指定父 block，而且这个文档可能不是标准 docx 格式。\n\n试试 append 到根 block：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_swkrlcd6hddt_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: 'k0S58I…PNOT' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    // Try appending to root block (document root id = doc token)\n    const blockBody = JSON.stringify({\n      children: [{\n        block_type: 2,\n        text: {\n          elements: [{ text_run: { content: 'Talus 写入测试 2026-05-28' } }]\n        }\n      }],\n      index: 12\n    });\n    // Target the root block itself as parent\n    const wopts = { \n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', \n      path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/blocks/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/children', \n      method: 'POST', \n      headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }\n    };\n    const wr = https.request(wopts, wres => {\n      let wd = '';\n      wres.on('data', c => wd += c);\n      wres.on('end', () => {\n        const r = JSON.parse(wd);\n        console.log('code:', r.code, 'msg:', r.msg);\n        if (r.data) console.log('OK');\n        else console.log('response:', wd.slice(0, 300));\n      });\n    });\n    wr.write(blockBody);\n    wr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":578,"output":866,"cacheRead":80032,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":81476,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779978190061,"responseId":"066782ceea43ec5fd58a68010e04ea40"}}
