{"type":"message","id":"c491e697","parentId":"601b0425","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:26.651Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Different error now - 1770001 invalid param. The path `/documents/{token}/blocks/{token}/children` is wrong because you can't append children to the root block using the document token as parent. I need to use a real block ID as parent.\n\nThe first block has ID `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` which is the root (block_type 1). Let me try appending to it.\n\nWait, actually error 1770001 says \"invalid param\" - this means the API endpoint EXISTS but the parameters are wrong. The token is wrong for the block parent ID. The root block ID should be the document token, but maybe it doesn't accept that.\n\n\nI should try passing the actual root block ID `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` as the parent in the path instead of the document token, though I'm wondering if block_type 1 even supports children operations. Looking at the block data, block types 3, 15, and 22 are the other top-level blocks, so I might need to append to one of those instead.\n","thinkingSignature":"e28f4790f48c0d303fcb91710158751b9956a2a66c94578c71337614cbc3d1eb"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_nzv7fvajne6r_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: 'k0S58I…PNOT' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    const blockBody = JSON.stringify({\n      children: [{\n        block_type: 2,\n        text: {\n          elements: [{ text_run: { content: '--- Talus 写入测试 2026-05-28 14:21 UTC ---' } }]\n        }\n      }],\n      index: 12\n    });\n    // Append to root block using its actual block id (MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc)\n    const wopts = { \n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', \n      path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/blocks/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/children', \n      method: 'POST', \n      headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }\n    };\n    const wr = https.request(wopts, wres => {\n      let wd = '';\n      wres.on('data', c => wd += c);\n      wres.on('end', () => {\n        const r = JSON.parse(wd);\n        console.log('code:', r.code, 'msg:', r.msg);\n        if (r.data) console.log('SUCCESS - block id:', r.data.blocks && r.data.blocks[0] && r.data.blocks[0].block_id);\n        else console.log('response:', wd.slice(0, 300));\n      });\n    });\n    wr.write(blockBody);\n    wr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":673,"output":787,"cacheRead":80576,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82036,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779978199198,"responseId":"066782d80743a0a846a5c0541b544529"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3e8576ed","parentId":"c491e697","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:27.620Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_nzv7fvajne6r_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"code: 1770001 msg: invalid param\nresponse: {\"code\":1770001,\"msg\":\"invalid param\",\"error\":{\"helps\":[{\"description\":\"确认参数是否合法\"}],\"log_id\":\"2026052822232727E7FC61E8CDF1067A39\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=2026052822232727E7FC61E8CDF1067A39&code=1770001&method_id=7055124"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":855,"aggregated":"code: 1770001 msg: invalid param\nresponse: {\"code\":1770001,\"msg\":\"invalid param\",\"error\":{\"helps\":[{\"description\":\"确认参数是否合法\"}],\"log_id\":\"2026052822232727E7FC61E8CDF1067A39\",\"troubleshooter\":\"排查建议查看(Troubleshooting suggestions): https://open.feishu.cn/search?from=openapi&log_id=2026052822232727E7FC61E8CDF1067A39&code=1770001&method_id=7055124","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779978207608}}
{"type":"message","id":"5f83e919","parentId":"3e8576ed","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:35.835Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root block ID and document token are the same. But we can't use the document token as the parent block ID. Let me look at the first block - it's block_type 1 (which is the document root). Its block_id is `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` same as the document token. Wait no, looking at the block list output, the first block is also `MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc` with block_type 1.\n\nBut actually block_type 1 is the \"page\" block type for docx. So the document has a root page block with the same ID as the document token.\n \nI'm realizing the structure might be that document_token = root page block ID. The blocks/children endpoint probably wants the root block ID rather than the document token, and looking at the block list output, the first block's block_id matches the document token, which makes sense since the root page block would have the same ID as the document itself.\n\nBut wait—if block_id equals document_token, then passing document_token as the parent block_id should work, yet I'm getting 404s on write but not on read. That could mean the token scope doesn't include write operations for that document, or the endpoint path itself is wrong. Let me try using block_type: 1 instead for the page block and see if that changes anything.\n\nActually, looking at the error response more carefully—it's 404 page not found, not a permissions error. So the issue isn't authorization; the endpoint path itself is wrong. Let me verify the correct API path for adding blocks, maybe using the actual block ID from that first block which has block_type: 1.\n","thinkingSignature":"61e46d3782b252baab29fb305f89908efb3dd17cb7061578b973fbfcb832d7f6"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_9nuzd8pxtbza_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: 'k0S58I…PNOT' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    \n    // Try correct API path with actual root block id\n    const blockBody = JSON.stringify({\n      children: [{\n        block_type: 2,\n        text: {\n          elements: [{ text_run: { content: '--- Talus 写入测试 2026-05-28 14:21 UTC ---' } }]\n        }\n      }],\n      index: 12\n    });\n    // Use the actual first block id (doxcnvuklhDQ7w3u6FBpARe4xZc) as parent\n    const wopts = { \n      hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', \n      path: '/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/MKJtwW9nriMKh3kMmz4c3Bubnoc/blocks/doxcnvuklhDQ7w3u6FBpARe4xZc/children', \n      method: 'POST', \n      headers: { 'Authorization': '***' + token, 'Content-Type': 'application/json' }\n    };\n    const wr = https.request(wopts, wres => {\n      let wd = '';\n      wres.on('data', c => wd += c);\n      wres.on('end', () => {\n        const r = JSON.parse(wd);\n        console.log('code:', r.code, 'msg:', r.msg);\n        if (r.data) console.log('SUCCESS');\n        else console.log('response:', wd.slice(0, 300));\n      });\n    });\n    wr.write(blockBody);\n    wr.end();\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":710,"output":899,"cacheRead":81216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82825,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779978207624,"responseId":"066782e03a0bc7180b30513aef636ec6"}}
