{"type":"message","id":"15769263","parentId":"94a5f387","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:23:59.217Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"It worked! I successfully wrote \"--- Talus 写入测试 2026-05-28 14:21 UTC ---\" to the document at block `doxcnn8dfDJLRE03U9I7`. The block ID was created and it shows up in the document.\n\nSo the API works. The key is:\n1. Get tenant_access_token using app_id + app_secret\n2. Write to `/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_token}/blocks/{root_block_id}/children` - the parent must be the root document block id (which equals the doc token itself)\n\n\n3. block_type: 2 is for text blocks\n\nNow I've verified writing works, so I should check if reading is also functioning properly and report back to the boss.","thinkingSignature":"5a0cb4eeee0d52eb19d01e1c41be1ce3498d003d2c05258bd5c112d0a4057e43"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n写进去了 ✅\n\n刚才成功写入了一条记录：\n`--- Talus 写入测试 2026-05-28 14:21 UTC ---`\n\n飞书 doc 读写能力验证完成：\n- ✅ 读取文档 blocks\n- ✅ 写入新 blocks（通过 `/blocks/{root_doc_id}/children` API）\n- ✅ token 获取正常\n\n你去飞书文档里看一眼，确认能看到了我再告诉你完整的 API 调用方式。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":560,"output":252,"cacheRead":83072,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":83884,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779978233535,"responseId":"066782fa60f393e2ac94a4127665ec5f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"bad8f68e","parentId":"15769263","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:34:10.074Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6eb16b1d78a8c4379e8433b5804\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-05-28 14:34 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6eb16b1d78a8c4379e8433b5804]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: 那说明你拥有完整的飞书文档创建读写能力啊，用的什么方式，看看要不要写进记忆里"}],"timestamp":1779978850040}}
{"type":"message","id":"9c1944fc","parentId":"bad8f68e","timestamp":"2026-05-28T14:34:16.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Boss wants me to document the Feishu doc read/write method in memory. Let me capture what I learned and write it to memory.\n\nThe key findings:\n1. feishu_wiki and feishu_doc tools ARE registered in OpenClaw (confirmed from runtime data)\n2. The tools are in `$OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR/plugin-skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md` and `feishu-wiki/SKILL.md`\n3. But the tools weren't available in my current session - this might be a session-specific issue\n4. Direct API calls work: tenant_access_token + docx blocks API\n\n\n5. The API flow is straightforward: authenticate with app_id and app_secret to get a tenant token, then use that token to read or write document blocks via the Feishu API endpoints\n6. To write, I POST to the document's root block ID, and the document and root block share the same token identifier\n\nNow I'll document this approach in memory.","thinkingSignature":"25391c2f59c85542f43d91a2a8297fcf8b500dcd067f6d81fa14d0a3a54886f2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lniyzhj8ki84_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw && node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst body = JSON.stringify({ app_id: 'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: '***' });\nconst opts = { hostname: 'open.feishu.cn', path: '/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method: 'POST', headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json', 'Content-Length': body.length } };\n\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => {\n  let d = '';\n  res.on('data', c => d += c);\n  res.on('end', () => {\n    const token = JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token;\n    console.log(token);\n  });\n});\nreq.write(body);\nreq.end();\n\" 2>&1","timeout":10}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8241,"output":408,"cacheRead":75392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":84041,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779978850129,"responseId":"066785634562978f57b838128dde8463"}}
