{"type":"message","id":"167ff049","parentId":"20b612ac","timestamp":"2026-05-28T17:15:41.973Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have good data. Let me compile a detailed comparison of 飞鹤星飞帆 vs 金领冠菁护 二段. The data shows:\n\nFor 飞鹤星飞帆 (classic/经典款) 二段:\n- 特色强化配方: OPO、OPN、乳清蛋白、叶黄素、CPP（酪蛋白磷酸肽）\n- SN-2棕榈酸提高到67%\n- 新一代专利OPO\n- GOS益生元\n\n\n- 水解蛋白、α-乳清蛋白\n\nFor 金领冠菁护 二段:\n- 特色强化配方: 乳铁蛋白(105mg/100g)、活性蛋白OPN、4倍益生菌、双重益生元\n- α-乳清蛋白\n- DHA和ARA含量都在100mg/100g以上\n\nI'm noting that these comparisons use different formula types, so I should look for more precise data to ensure accuracy.\n","thinkingSignature":"599456809649115e1b58814f756f5b85417210bcf1f50040c6770566382e1115"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lu74zfk35dti_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":10000,"url":"https://www.naifen123.cn/item-mobile-do-detailyy-id-1271.html"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lu74zfk35dti_2","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":10000,"url":"https://www.naifen123.cn/item-mobile-do-detailyy-id-242.html"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10531,"output":296,"cacheRead":95210,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":106037,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779988533756,"responseId":"0667ab36ca846d927ba8f0aa3b15abea"}}
