{"type":"message","id":"a0cd63ab","parentId":"169c8741","timestamp":"2026-05-28T17:15:52.147Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have detailed nutritional data for both products. Let me also get the special/enhanced formula info.\n\nFor 星飞帆 2段:\n- DHA: 1.29mg/100kj\n- ARA: 2.70mg/100kj\n- 叶黄素: 9.00ug/100kj\n- 硒: 0.00ug/100kj (not detected)\n\nFor 菁护 2段:\n- DHA: 1.00mg/100kj\n- ARA: 2.00mg/100kj\n- 叶黄素: 10.00ug/100kj\n\n\n- 硒: 0.72ug/100kj\n\nNow I'm looking at the complete nutritional breakdown across all the key vitamins and minerals for both products.\n\nI'm noticing some discrepancies in the data I received - the 硒 content for 星飞帆 shows 0.00, which doesn't align with what appeared in the earlier search results suggesting it had higher levels. I should also pull the enhanced formula information from naifen123 to get the full picture of what both products offer.\n","thinkingSignature":"de96a5878cace1c278af139adcbb1d4584426c1a998880525f1d648ae12a28ab"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_n52p3l09v0if_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"maxChars":8000,"url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/660330027"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":6887,"output":278,"cacheRead":100817,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":107982,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779988544542,"responseId":"0667ab416bb1eac02b0e4bdc7c2378e7"}}
